+For every prime ell≥5, the same argument applies to the relative pro-ell groups with S3 quotient. Schur–Zassenhaus supplies compatible finite complements, coprime H1 supplies strict centralizers, and all denominators in B.26 are units in Z_ell. Corrections converge in every finite ell-group quotient. Thus every invariant actual pro-ell automorphism has a compatible relative lift, including the nonpentagonal q7 elements. This argument does not cover ell=2,3, where the relative complement and averaging steps fail.
